# EmailJS Configuration
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> get SERVICE_ID (e.g. service_xxxxxxx)
# 3. Create an Email Template -> get TEMPLATE_ID (e.g. template_xxxxxxx)
#    Template variables: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}, {{to_name}}
# 4. In Account > Security / Public Key -> get PUBLIC_KEY (e.g. xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx)
# 5. Copy this file to .env and insert your real keys:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
